## Custom congrats

holiday-custom-new-cycle-day = The sector calendar turns over to a new cycle. The old IFF codes expired at midnight, so recalibrate before you shoot anyone.
holiday-custom-articles-day = Gliess Santo reads Leo King's Articles aloud on every dock. Foreign warrants remain unrecognized.
holiday-custom-recurrence-day = The wreck fields are recurring again. You have seen this day before, and you will see it again.
holiday-custom-sweethearts-watch = Write to someone you love before your next jump. The comms relays will not wait for you to find the words.
holiday-custom-idol-broadcast = Shinohara Heavy Industries broadcasts its idol concert sector-wide. Attendance is mandatory for all employees.
holiday-custom-workers-rising = On this day the workers of Vaucelles rose, and Vaucelles became Chengridz. Red flags fly from every League hull.
holiday-custom-navigators-day = Navigators' Day. Round your jump coordinates to at least four decimal places.
holiday-custom-false-flag-day = Every diplomatic declaration made today is legally binding. Probably. Double-check that IFF signature before you open fire.
holiday-custom-first-jump-day = On this day the first bluespace jump into Crescent was made. Every hull in the sector still follows that route.
holiday-custom-homeguard-remembrance = The Homeguard remembers the cadres who fell in the first uprising. Stand a silent watch for them.
holiday-custom-charter-day = The Divine Sol Mandate celebrates Count Olywier Rabenau's Crescent charter. Seals are polished, oaths are renewed, taxes are collected.
holiday-custom-damage-control-day = Thank your damage control crews. Then go vent the fire in section four.
holiday-custom-drone-appreciation-day = Thank your maintenance drones. They will not remember it, but you will.
holiday-custom-federation-day = GSC, Interdyne, Cyberdawn and SAW mark the signing of the Federation charter. Shinohara did not send a card.
holiday-custom-salvagers-day = The Iron Ring Company honors salvage crews across the sector. One captain's wreck is another crew's payday.
holiday-custom-long-rain-day = On Gliess it has now rained for a full year without stopping. Bring a coat planetside.
holiday-custom-corpsmens-day = Thank a corpsman. They have seen what you look like on the inside.
holiday-custom-old-taypan-day = Old Taypan remembers its lost independence. The passports still say neutral, even if nobody respects them.
holiday-custom-allies-day = Renew an alliance at the diplomacy console today. Or at least do not declare war before lunch.
holiday-custom-old-oaths = Taypani-Atyrian families renew their old oaths across the mobile fleets. Psionics report a quiet hum on every channel.
holiday-custom-dockside-brew-day = Every bar on Gliess Santo pours its own brew tonight. The Sheriffs will be watching the docks.
holiday-custom-shinohara-founders-day = Shinohara Heavy Industries celebrates its founding. Every employee receives one complimentary ration bar.
holiday-custom-systems-engineers-day = It is the 256th day of the year. Thank your systems engineers, and keep your hands off their consoles.
holiday-custom-raiders-day = Every raider in Crescent flies the black flag openly today. The Sheriffs of Gliess Santo are not amused.
holiday-custom-cadet-questions-day = There are no stupid questions today. Ask your chief engineer why the AME is making that noise.
holiday-custom-mascots-day = Feed the ship's mascot. It has survived more boardings than you have.
holiday-custom-nova-belraska = The League remembers Nova Belraska. Stand a silent watch for the homes that burned.
holiday-custom-turning-night = Tonight aberrant things grow in the dark of the wreck fields. Keep your lights on and your hatches sealed.
holiday-custom-opening-of-the-hunt = The Saint's Militia opens the season of the Hunt. Keep your psionics quiet and your airlocks bolted.
holiday-custom-ceasefire-day = Remember the dead of every flag. Hold your fire for one minute at noon.
holiday-custom-hailing-day = Hail an unknown ship on comms today. Be polite. Keep your guns warm.
holiday-custom-minutemen-muster = The Colonial Minutemen muster for public patrol, as they did when Analiesse still flew. Taypani routes are being watched.
holiday-custom-long-night-lights = The Long Night has come to Crescent. Hang lights on the turrets.
holiday-custom-archivists-day = The archivists of Vogsburg celebrate their day. Every war in Crescent ends as a footnote.
holiday-custom-survivors-day = You have survived another year in Sector Crescent. Statistically, that is impressive.
holiday-custom-gift-exchange = For three days even rival flags exchange gifts. Check yours for Shinohara tracking chips.
holiday-custom-omen-day = An unlucky day by every spacer's superstition. Your ship's engines have noticed.
